  "goodToKnow": "Taugen means to be good for something or of use: Das taugt nichts (that's useless), Taugt der Film was? (is the film any good?). In southern Germany and Austria, Das taugt mir means I like it. Tauglich means fit or suitable: tauglich for military service, alltagstauglich (suitable for everyday use). Der Taugenichts is a good-for-nothing, as in Eichendorff's 1826 novella Aus dem Leben eines Taugenichts."
